@UTF8
@Begin
@Languages:	eng
@Participants:	CHI Child
@ID:	eng|sample|CHI|||||Child|||
@Media:	wor-replacements, audio
@Comment:	Authored word-timing controls: replacements retain the spoken
	original's timing whether the target contains one or several words.
*CHI:	this is child [: children] speaking . 100_500
%wor:	this 100_200 is 200_300 child 300_400 speaking 400_500 .
*CHI:	this is child [: younger child] speaking . 500_900
%wor:	this 500_600 is 600_700 child 700_800 speaking 800_900 .
@End
